sequenceDiagram
  title User Login
  participant p1 as Browser
  participant p2 as Web App
  participant p3 as Auth Service
  participant p4 as User Database
  p1->>p2: login request
  p2->>p3: credential check
  p3->>p4: verify credentials
  p4-->>p3: verification result
  alt success
    p3-->>p2: token
    p2-->>p1: 200 OK / token
  else failure
    p3-->>p2: error
    p2-->>p1: 401 Unauthorized / error
  end
